{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "95a111b0616355f1565bc0d541bd6f4b65af118ab0a17a0724f97a4f06eafacb", "ja": "お仕事はちゃんとしてるつもりだけど、\nもしおしゃべりが長いなら、問題だよね……？", "zh": "我自认为工作做得还算认真，\n但如果聊天时间太长的话，就成问题了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b0c063db0f3d3f0a57ead599bc02196ef3fad0ab627b244e48733545946b3d54", "ja": "よし。長くおしゃべりしないように、\nお仕事のことだけ話すようにしなくちゃ……！", "zh": "好。为了不聊得太久，\n得注意只聊工作上的事才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "91c89b3630720262c1a7acac59ec227d3323f542045abf084a0906b345cbf6a6", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。取引先から\nマカロンをいただいたんですけど、いかがですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。客户送了些马卡龙，您要不要来一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "5047a1a454f4a8b329e300bb1ec60ac454238667d4949e300b6f4d741a1004d5", "ja": "わあ、いいんですか？　いただきます！\nとってもオシャレで、かわいいマカロンですね～♪", "zh": "哇，可以吗？那我就不客气啦！\n这马卡龙特别时髦，真可爱呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "0570b622bf567c3f5d7eceb45c88d2a7adff14fe01641c8f3412b4ec91ad100d", "ja": "どれから手をつけようか迷っちゃうな～……\n色もきれいで、なんだか宝石箱みたいですね♪", "zh": "不知道该先从哪个下手呢～……\n颜色也很漂亮，感觉就像珠宝盒一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4a439cb6eda4430b5c1f5774a51854232b6a435bb6b4c18231a1615b7c5d8656", "ja": "あはは、そんなに喜んでもらえてよかったです。\n宝石箱……確かに、キラキラしていますね。", "zh": "哈哈，你能这么高兴真是太好了。\n珠宝盒……确实，看起来闪闪发光的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "bfdc8b63b5c4814f2647f2824f2a7a3c58e6f95bdc4422571d553878d1648ecf", "ja": "はい！　色とりどりのキラキラしたお菓子が並んで、\n見ているだけでわくわくしちゃいますから！", "zh": "是的！五颜六色、闪闪发光的点心整齐排列着，光是看着就让人兴奋不已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "54786129502e4923a2f26096996d2569d3809f46ba6996acda5a0185caeed95e", "ja": "しかもおいしいんだから、マカロンはすごいなって……\nはっ！？　すみません、私ってば、つい長話を……。", "zh": "而且还很好吃，马卡龙真是太厉害了……  \n啊！？对不起，我一不小心就说了这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "778aa592a072a25fc83e746111e87f187c87758aedaf17cf39c94c97156b0797", "ja": "いえいえ。青羽さんのお話、参考になりますよ。\nそういう感性が、衣装作りに活きてるんだなって！", "zh": "不不，青羽小姐说的这些很有参考价值。\n原来正是这种感性，运用在服装制作上了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "d6e67fc1f027e00cd59963347a15b00edc3a238c7e5c0f007a039fbbc7e66bea", "ja": "そ、そうですか……？\nえへへ……それならよかったです♪", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？\n嘿嘿……那就太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "30fefd379044aabd93b803109c0542b8fec81d3d9fc9605c7e408a34d4c424c9", "ja": "そうだ！　それじゃあもうひとつおしゃべりを。\n社長さんが、時間がある時に来てほしいそうですよ。", "zh": "对了！那再说一件事吧。  \n社长说，如果您有时间，希望您过去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ce60edd66d11f1b42d1b2c987ab09cf5e6813ca127961666abf7a04a7936bcb1", "ja": "そうでしたか。ちょうど時間も空いてるし、\n今行ってみる事にします。", "zh": "这样啊。正好我也有时间，\n这就过去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9be033c33c76e6d84fab85a1ddcad3f42bb3852400f89b18e312c2e48fe0522", "ja": "はーい、いってらっしゃ～い！　マカロンは、\n劇場にいるみんなでわけますね～♪", "zh": "好——路上小心～！马卡龙就由剧场里的大家一起分着吃吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "7c079c2fa6d99d0914eb5ef9202d840252ca58c3e212817d061e78a9d37bfea0", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "abf7e92f2581753ed4171f37c923332507af900ea9e810a2f759dc2ab1898581", "ja": "お疲れさまです、音無さん。\nあれ？　社長は今どちらに……？", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐。\n咦？社长现在在哪儿……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "5fb2fb79a4ed440f31430c138c5d5c8e6f935cca95ba78f339348c999838e293", "ja": "社長は、ちょうど来客中で……\n多分もうすこしで終わると思うんですけど。", "zh": "社长正好在接待客人……\n我想应该快结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7948c9cc8871a9ea2404110fce52b1209dccfe536d27561dc7730fcb45580e2a", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nじゃあ、ちょっと待ちますね。", "zh": "这样啊。\n那我稍微等一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1018_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1019_syorounojyosei", "source_sha256": "5af58a737eabce015cd4675e0ffecfca1d4afebcf2166667284b640109765b2e", "ja": "それじゃあね、順ちゃん。\nまた詳しい事が決まったら連絡するわね。", "zh": "那就先这样，小顺。等详细情况定下来后，我再联系你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "19270c19990db3bfc74949740f40b3b69140ea7511193eb5ab64a255f337754e", "ja": "よろしく頼むよ！　……やあ、君！\n待たせてしまったようで、悪かったね。", "zh": "拜托你了！……嗨，你好！\n好像让你久等了，真抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "217e61964227ec634f4e0efb16ea9506d59ada2c76f61516584ebf933d0f76ab", "ja": "いえ、今来たばかりですから。\n今の方は……？", "zh": "不会，我也才刚到。\n刚才那位是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "73482c9b1928dd9957409db61785614bf2be9885fcb0dbb95dd0e4c1f77f9f24", "ja": "私の古い友人でね、腕の立つ映像作家なんだ。\n今話題の口紅のCM、あれも彼女の手によるものだよ。", "zh": "她是我的老朋友，也是一位技艺高超的影像创作者。\n最近很受关注的那支口红广告，就是她拍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "a1aae0a3d513556e7b11c385bedf3431df41b94411240ee4c22add310bcc7fa0", "ja": "ああ！　あのCM、素敵ですよね！\n私もあのリップ、欲しくなっちゃいました♪", "zh": "啊！那支广告，真的很棒呢！\n我也突然想要那支唇膏了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "53cf3879f7643b31556fe0423c76c61621444989e27166a2c0fa24fd0697cdfb", "ja": "彼女の作ったCMやPVは、時代を超え愛されている。\nまあ、話が長いのが少々難点だがね。はっはっは。", "zh": "她制作的广告和PV跨越时代，深受喜爱。\n不过，话多算是她稍微有点美中不足的地方就是了。哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "770e529672e7c45434b07668fcdffd1df0bf31e2945ebbad0086ef9903e35bfb", "ja": "PVを撮る映像作家……そして、\n呼ばれたタイミング……もしかして、社長！", "zh": "拍摄PV的影像作家……再加上，\n叫我过来的时机……难道说，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "f29058e3238c11b3b2661fdbc05fa37b78b9257a0c2cb4e03abee20a36a66afd", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル達の新ユニットを君に任せたい！\nPVも力を入れる予定で、彼女に打診をしたところだ！", "zh": "嗯！我想把偶像们的新组合交给你！\nPV方面也打算全力以赴，我已经去向她试探过意向了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6d821e996b5b5674db7ccf0ac2f7bbd606a54b76932c1799bfe9a5a73971cdd5", "ja": "やっぱり……！　もちろん、任せてください！\n全力で頑張ります！", "zh": "果然……！当然没问题，交给我吧！\n我会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "026637bf4d3faa1e9659380db5b522a109a23f41a71575ea0b4ecc4f76e35d7a", "ja": "あの映像作家さんの作品って、ちょっと芸術肌な\n感じですよね？　今回はそういう方向性なんですか？", "zh": "那位影像作家的作品，感觉很有艺术气息呢？这次也是这种方向吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "ad3d45606fb707eb2dfbbd7e29cee9256547eab8fe6e044d6e1ac93a91c6b3b7", "ja": "うむ。今回の新曲に、ピッタリだと思ってね。\n早速だが、新曲のデモを聴いてもらおうか。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得非常适合这次的新曲。\n事不宜迟，来听听新曲的试听版吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "43f2b5d356cc9c5386b5ebaa14a3b0942c25683c9074912386724232d5bb183c", "ja": "華やかで、それでいてしっとりした雰囲気の\n曲ですね♪　アンニュイっていうのかしら……♪", "zh": "这首曲子既华丽，又带着一种沉静的氛围呢♪\n怎么说呢，有种慵懒的味道……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "af5155ecebc21be5593bd147af0a0bf37913653e798e2261996d6ab233a63266", "ja": "そうですね……雰囲気のある曲なので、\nそれに合うメンバーを、さっそく考えてみます！", "zh": "没错……这是一首很有氛围的歌曲，\n我马上来考虑适合它的成员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "fa0685c65d31ae4849eb7cb8e8d78c69ed8d12dbbf96d45b825c0f3d847e4679", "ja": "早速、やる気に満ち溢れているようだね！\n素晴らしい！", "zh": "看来你已经干劲十足了！\n太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "b4f47c7acaa77abfc39443f7e2a5c7d011dda749fdf722fa3adc134aaa90668b", "ja": "ぜひこのユニットを形にして、\nPVも歌も、素敵なものに仕上げてくれたまえ！", "zh": "请务必将这个组合化为现实，\n把PV和歌曲也都制作得精彩绝伦吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "55870b64b575b58d0e9416056dff3b26c7054b6c42e3ac6894a79235d5f7bca2", "ja": "はい、頑張ります！", "zh": "好的，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "4844f4b7b0553a676f8a0781439c07182da9a30e0b768a214a73c21f7622af94", "ja": "（この楽曲なら、アイドル達の新たな一面も\n切り取れそうだ。さて、これから忙しくなるぞ！）", "zh": "（这首歌应该能展现偶像们崭新的一面。好了，接下来可要忙起来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
